<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings - AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings - AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---09/28/96  09/21/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		   -10.3	16,875    18,816    29,448</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   4.1	 9,231     8,866     9,850</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  51.2	 1,746     1,155     1,428</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -2.3	19,067    19,516    21,117</p>
